{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14212170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1421217001:1":{"text":"이곳이 페리엘의 실험의 숲입니까?","source_cn":"这就是斐利尔的实验林地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C748A6C08F346F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421217002:0":{"text":"예쁘다... 페리엘 님이 여기에 땅거미 숲의 모습을 재현해 두신 걸까요?","source_cn":"好漂亮……这些植物的排列，是斐利尔大人重现的一片薄暮丛林吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E7FC02014C7A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421217003:0":{"text":"어? 저건... 페리엘 님의 작은 동물 친구들인가요?","source_cn":"咦？那些是……斐利尔大人的小动物朋友们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C70A96230623E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421217004:1":{"text":"기운이 없는 것 같아요... 아무도 돌봐주지 않아서 그런 걸까요?","source_cn":"它们看起来很虚弱……是不是因为缺乏照料？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x701709872E68F99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421217005:1":{"text":"힘이 없어 보입니다.","source_cn":"它们似乎失去了活力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1BBADCEB502A012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":""